  "jobTitle": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "summary": "Developing and deploying real IT solutions to solve business problems with an emphasis on quality, efficiency, and overall functionality is what I do. For nearly two decades, I have been championing changes that support the evolving needs of the end users. My focus is on steering the full process from system analysis and testing through programming, updating, and overhauling to support business excellence. After conducting much research, I am eager to apply for position of QA Test Analyst or Senior Programmer Analyst.\r\n\r\nThroughout my professional career, I have leveraged superior technical acumen and bilingual communications abilities to consistently exceed expectations. My record of success includes scripting SQL queries which would report critical decision information to help users take corrective and decisive actions, writing Cobol programs, and writing panel prompted CLIST applications which served as a catalyst to post and retrieve billing dialogs from relational databases. I believe that my analytical, results-driven mindset will make me a strong asset to your organization.\r\n\r\nAs an accomplished Senior Programmer Analyst who excels in challenging, dynamic environments, I look forward to discovering a great fit between myself and your organization .",
